[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0010","text":"──啊\n制作人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0020","text":"辛苦了，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0030","text":"哦\n辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0040","text":"赶上了呢\n能在录音前见到你太好了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0050","text":"让你们久等了……！\n──不过，看你们俩都很放松的样子，我就放心了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0060","text":"是吗？\n不过刚才，我和阳希酱都在发抖呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0070","text":"试了好多缓解紧张的方法──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0080","text":"羽、羽那酱\n路加酱先走了～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0090","text":"诶！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700100_01_0100","text":"哇——\n等等路加酱～～————！"}]
